    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then the number of elements in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>T</mi></math> is",
