  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mtext>Integers</mtext></math>, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;can be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Now out of these values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;only&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;will satisfy&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
